stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested
    Requested --> AuthorityCheck
    AuthorityCheck --> Refused: authority missing/denied
    AuthorityCheck --> DependencyCheck: authority admitted
    DependencyCheck --> Refused: dependency unavailable
    DependencyCheck --> ConstructingProvider: dependencies fresh
    ConstructingProvider --> Materializing
    Materializing --> Refused: provider returns materialize refusal
    Materializing --> EpisodeReady: accepted + episode identity
    EpisodeReady --> Observed: initial observation captured
    Observed --> Active
    Active --> Acting: admitted ActuationIntent
    Acting --> Active: result + observation recorded
    Active --> Teardown
    Teardown --> Closed
    Refused --> [*]
    Closed --> [*]
